<p class="lesson-lead">After the exam, the games keep coming: the grid/symmetry jam, then two placeholder flex days whose topic arrives with the season — closing the year with the same ritual it began with: pitch, build, playtest, ship, retro.</p>

<h2>Lessons</h2>
<table>
